WEBVTT

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.216
There was a girl in one of the windows
and she was dancing.

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:33.416
It was very peculiar,
because it was dark out,

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.656
but she was backlit
with florescent lighting.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:36.936
She was very much onstage

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.176
and I couldn't figure out
why she was doing it.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.376
After about 15 seconds,
her friend appeared --

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:43.216
she had been hiding behind a display.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.376
They laughed, hugged
each other and ran away.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.136
Maybe she had been dared to do this.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.456
So I got inspired by that.

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.416
Looking at the entire facade --
there were 70 total windows --

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:52.816
and I knew what I had to do.

00:04:52.840 --> 00:04:54.376
(Laughter)

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.296
So this project is called Look Up More.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.896
We had 70 actors dress in black.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.536
This was completely unauthorized.

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:01.696
We didn't let the stores know
we were coming.